{"title":"2024 CMO(CHINA)","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The 40rd <b>CMO</b> was held between November 25 and December 1, 2024. The first link will contain the full set of test problems. The rest will contain each individual problem and its solution.\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CMO_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CMO Problems (page does not exist)\">2024 CMO Problems</a>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2024 CMO Problems/Problem 1\">2024 CMO Problems/Problem 1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CMO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CMO Problems/Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">2024 CMO Problems/Problem 2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CMO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CMO Problems/Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">2024 CMO Problems/Problem 3</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2024 CMO Problems/Problem 4\">2024 CMO Problems/Problem 4</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2024 CMO Problems/Problem 5\">2024 CMO Problems/Problem 5</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CMO_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CMO Problems/Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">2024 CMO Problems/Problem 6</a></li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:40%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2024 CMO(CHINA)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CMO(CHINA)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CMO(CHINA) Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=27&amp;year=2024\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CMO(CHINA)\" title=\"2023 CMO(CHINA)\">2023 CMO(CHINA)</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CMO(CHINA)&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CMO(CHINA) (page does not exist)\">2025 CMO(CHINA)</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CMO(CHINA)_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CMO(CHINA) Problems/Problem 1 (page does not exist)\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CMO(CHINA)_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CMO(CHINA) Problems/Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CMO(CHINA)_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CMO(CHINA) Problems/Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CMO(CHINA)_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CMO(CHINA) Problems/Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CMO(CHINA)_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CMO(CHINA) Problems/Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CMO(CHINA)_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CMO(CHINA) Problems/Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">6</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CMO(CHINA)_Problems_and_Solutions\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"CMO(CHINA) Problems a